摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"deepseek harness opencode + omo (oh-my-openagent) preset","id":"gh:1335620948","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-opencode-omo","slug":"royenheart/dsh-plugin-opencode-omo","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","opencode"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"deepseek harness opencode + omo (oh-my-openagent) preset"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @royenheart/dsh-plugin-opencode-omo"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that adds an `opencode-omo` agent preset (mode) to the web profile. The mo"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"de replicates the behavior of **opencode** + the **omo** plugin (oh-my-openagent), scoped to this mo"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"de only — other presets (`standard`/…) keep the default dsh loop, sandboxed fs, and no omo hooks."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## What the mode provides"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **opencode + omo system prompt** — the real opencode `default.txt` persona (tone, style, proactive"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ness, conventions, code style, task guidance) + omo's Sisyphus orchestrator identity, declared as th"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"e **complete** system prompt: the dsh harness identity and runtime-context snapshot are suppressed f"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"or this mode. The loop shim additionally prepends opencode's **live environment block** (exact model"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" id, working dir, workspace root, git, platform, date, recomputed every step).\n- **omo role picker i"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"n the composer** — in dsh's existing `conversation.input.left` tool-row slot (after the access/plan "},{"id":"p5s7","text":"chips), the primary/all roles `sisyphus`, `hephaestus` (Deep Agent), `prometheus` (Plan Builder), `a"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"tlas` (Plan Executor), and `sisyphus-junior`. Selecting one swaps the session's complete system prom"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"pt and applies that role's configured model. Specialist roles (`athena`, `athena-junior`, `council-m"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"ember`, `metis`, `momus`, `oracle`, `librarian`, `explore`, `multimodal-looker`) are reached through"},{"id":"p5s11","text":" `task(subagent_type=...)`, not the composer picker.\n- **Global \"Role Settings\"** in the dsh setting"},{"id":"p5s12","text":"s panel (`settings.section`): per-role primary model dropdown (follow current / omo default / fixed)"},{"id":"p5s13","text":" under a centered \"Primary model\" label; a dsh-style circle \"+\" button opens a fallback model list b"},{"id":"p5s14","text":"elow the role box (repeatable additions, cancel/close adds nothing), persisted in the `opencode-omo`"},{"id":"p5s15","text":" settings entry. On request failure the loop shim advances through the role's fallback chain before "},{"id":"p5s16","text":"the harness retry policy runs.\n- **opencode toolchain (complete)** — persistent `bash`, `read`/`writ"},{"id":"p5s17","text":"e`/`edit`/`read_image`, `apply_patch`, `glob`/`grep`, `todo_write`, `skill`, `web_fetch`/`web_search"},{"id":"p5s18","text":"`, the LSP navigation surface (`lsp_goto_definition` / `lsp_find_references` / `lsp_hover` / `lsp_go"},{"id":"p5s19","text":"_to_implementation`; raw `lsp` is hidden), `exit_plan_mode` (plan), `ask_user_question`. `tool-surfa"},{"id":"p5s20","text":"ce.mjs` overwrites the model-visible descriptions/parameters with opencode's `tool/*.txt` text and s"},{"id":"p5s21","text":"hims `read`/`edit`/`write`/`web_search` to opencode's parameter names (`web_search.query` → dsh `que"},{"id":"p5s22","text":"t`/`write`/`web_search` to opencode's parameter names (`web_search.query` → dsh `queries`).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"`lib/` is generated locally and is not committed. `install.py` always builds the repository's own to"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"olchain first (`npm ci` when the toolchain is missing or `package-lock.json` is newer than the insta"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"lled lock, then `npm run build`) and exits with an actionable error if npm, the build, the artifacts"},{"id":"p9s4","text":", or a required harness link is missing:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"`install.py` symlinks the package into `~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/node_modules/`, mirrors runtime pa"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ckages only when absent, ensures/repoints the LSP links (refusing real directories), and edits the p"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"rofile's `package.json` (adds/removes the dependency + bundle entry). The bundle patch declares both"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" the host row and the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset` row, so there is no separate user-pre"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"and the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset` row, so there is no separate user-preset-root copy."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Manual alternative — the package is a dsh **bundle**: it declares `dsh.bundle.patch` and ships the p"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"reset. `dsh plugin` reconciles `dsh.profile.bundles` from the installed package automatically:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The bundle patch declares the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset` row for `opencode-omo`, so no"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" `$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets` copy is published. Restart dsh and select **opencode-omo** from the mode"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"OME/.agent-presets` copy is published. Restart dsh and select **opencode-omo** from the mode picker."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Upgrading from the pre-0.2.1 row id.** Existing profiles used the\n`opencode-omo-roles` settings en"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"try; rc.2's legacy importer preserves that\nunknown entry in `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml.imported`. On b"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"oot the host row reads that backup once per profile and merges its\nrole/session maps into the active"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" `opencode-omo` entry, so old role models and\nfallbacks are not silently reset. Profiles migrated by"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" the pre-release\n`9ad557c` home-global marker may re-import once because that marker had no\nprofile "},{"id":"p15s6","text":"identity; review the merged roles after upgrading."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Optional LSP server.** The preset preconfigures `typescript-language-server` for the `lsp_*` navig"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ation tools. `install.py` checks `PATH` and warns when it is missing; the optional LSP module then m"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ounts without a provider so the mode still loads (LSP queries fail gracefully instead of blocking th"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"e whole preset). Install it to enable LSP:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Required dsh-side changes"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"One patch is still required for the complete opencode surface:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`patches/0001-agent-pre-step-assistant-prefill.patch` (rebased onto\n`dsh-v0.2.1-rc.2`) adds `PreStep"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"Decision.assistantPrefill`, a request-only\nassistant tail. The loop logs it on `request/header`, app"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ends it to exactly the\nrequest that asked for it, and prices it in token pressure; it is never a\nses"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"sion `assistant/message`, so transcript, compaction, and stats stay clean."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Apply it to the dsh checkout with the instructions in\n`patches/README.md`; `install.py` does not mod"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ify the harness\ncheckout. Without the patch the preset still loads and uses the fallback below."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Why the patch is still required.** opencode appends `MAX_STEPS_PROMPT` as an\nassistant-role contin"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"uation on the ceiling step. Official 0.2.1\n`PreStepDecision` is still `reject | { kind: 'enter', mes"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"sages, startsRequestSeries? }`,\nand `agent/request` cannot mutate request messages, so no official e"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"xtension\npoint can express a request-only assistant tail. Upstream request:\ndiscussion #2407."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin probes the runtime capability\n(`ctx.agentLoop.supportsAssistantPrefill`). On a patched ho"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"st the ceiling text is\nan assistant tail and no system-prompt section is added. On a stock host it\nk"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"eeps the same text and trigger as a system-prompt section (see the fallback\ntable below); that is su"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"rvivability, not the complete opencode surface."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Fallback on unpatched hosts"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Surface | opencode / patched harness | This plugin on a stock 0.2.1 host |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
